  <item>
    <title>052. 出行运满满，是一种什么样的体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a69d15556a3f3491ba6ea45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a69d15556a3f3491ba6ea45</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我和闺蜜，和我的活佛Bro在加德满都体验了五天超预期的假期。</span></p><p><span>关于宗教和因果，总是平等地应验在每一个人身上。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 尼泊尔的宗教氛围超浓</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> Yo 的活佛好朋友，也是Yo 的活佛Bro</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 零攻略的旅途，全程有NPC伴随</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 加德满都杜巴广场活女神庙里的保安小哥和导游大哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 一个“有身份”的人是什么样的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 去了莲花山大师修行过的山洞，被活佛Bro带去的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 两个麻瓜经历过的法事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 直升机公司也安排了NPC</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> Yo 在加德满都任何情况下都要买票</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 世界上最大的佛塔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 在坦帕杜巴广场遇到的NPC，带我们去了黄金庙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 在黄金庙又遇到一个NPC</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 坦帕杜巴广场很适合买佛像和唐卡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 最好的佛像店主</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 终于找到了美丽羊绒披肩的店铺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 信佛也要信美丽的佛（绿度母）</span></p><p><span>我们不需要太在意仪式和名号。</span></p><p><span>所有一心向善的人，都会好人有好报的。</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662e56bc64cc324d647f213a/lh52kDnzxnCF8bFDCSeYGw0rx4p4.m4a" length="58827288" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpzlJ-1Ap6p5nbfd8cLwpX09PoYt.jpg"/>
